sets/steam/apps/2688400/extras/f37fafe68864dc81f574c2a95c0319fe.mp4?t=1737937942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>6. Creative Doodles:</strong> Draw on the colored patterns and create interesting doodles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688400/extras/64582c497d804c4a0d4b918aabe0781a.poster.avif?t=1737937942\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688400/extras/64582c497d804c4a0d4b918aabe0781a.webm?t=1737937942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688400/extras/64582c497d804c4a0d4b918aabe0781a.mp4?t=1737937942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you're a seasoned artist or a novice doodler, <i>You draw, I guess</i> offers you a diverse and inclusive space for you to express yourself through art and storytelling.",
